{
  "thought": "I keep failing to write the file because my content was cut off. Let me try again with a complete, properly formatted file. The implementation needs to: validate idle_days, parse movements, compute on-hand by SKU, find last shipment day per SKU, and return sorted SKUs that are dead stock.",
